then $Qw\not\in \mathbb{Z}^d$ for any $w\in\mathcal U_{M^c}$  and its
denominator is bounded by $N^D$. We can assume, without of loss of
generality, that $Qw\in[0, 1)^d$ by the periodicity of  $x\mapsto e^{-2\pi i x\cdot
